<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Union target upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Union target upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it raised the 12-month price target for First Union Corp to $104.</p>
<p>-- said continued to recommend purchase of shares.</p>
<p>-- stock closed up 5/8 to 87-3/4 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
